			(property "Description" "1MHz 7A integrated-switch synchronous buck (step-down) regulator, VOUT adj. down to 0.7V. QFN-24 (ML) 4x4mm 0.5mm pitch; EP (pad 25) ties to SGND (pin 16) per the typical application circuit. Hub VDD-core buck (kills the MPM3833C 3A headroom risk per BOM-A/hub-ent-bom-detailed.md)."
